## 3. DIRECTIONAL QUERIES

### 3.1 EAST — Vision Inquiry (🌅 Waabinong — Yellow — Spring — Tobacco)

**Tool**: `east_vision_inquiry`

**Query**: "What relational obligations and stakeholders exist for Miadi orchestration ontologies?"
**Stakeholders**: orchestration agents, plugin authors, ceremony keepers, Miadi kit users

**Direction Response Summary**:
```
Direction: EAST (Waabinong — Yellow — Spring — Tobacco)
Stage: Birth-7 Years: Good Life (New Beginnings)

Ceremony Guidance:
  Opening Practice: Smudging with tobacco
  Intention: Honor spirits entering research circle; thank land & ancestors
  Protocol: Place tobacco on ground; offer gratitude for all relations;
            acknowledge that knowledge belongs to community

Relational Obligations:
  Human Relations: Listen deeply to community stories; honor every voice
  Land Relations: Acknowledge territory before beginning
  Spirit Relations: Invite ancestral knowledge holders
```

**LLMS-txt Ontological Insight** (East):
> MCP Transparent Integration belongs to the East. Vision must be clear and shared before tools can be registered or trusted. Transparency IS the relational obligation — every MCP tool registration is an act of making visible what was hidden, grounding capability in accountability.

---

### 3.2 SOUTH — Growth Practice (🌞 Zhaawanong — Red — Summer — Cedar)

**Tool**: `south_growth_practice`

**Query**: "How do ontologies for plugin architecture and handoff contracts embody and grow in Miadi kits?"

**Direction Response Summary**:
```
Direction: SOUTH (Zhaawanong — Red — Summer — Cedar)
Stage: 7-14 Years: Fast Life (Growth & Embodiment)

Medicine:
  Cedar (Grandmother): Free medicine, cleansing, protection
  Properties: Makes anew what journey doesn't need
  Usage: Smudging, tea, baths — purification and renewal

Teachings:
  Core: Life awake and dancing; spirit nurturance critical; growth through embodied experience
  Mentorship: Elders invite (don't command); mentorship heals
  Intuition: Listen to spirit's warnings; intuition never lies
```

**LLMS-txt Ontological Insight** (South):
> Copilot Plugin Architecture belongs to the South. Plugins grow through embodied practice — they are not declared into existence but invited into service by the community they will serve. Cedar cleanses what the plugin no longer needs; the community governs what plugins may become.

---

### 3.3 WEST — Reflection Ceremony (🌄 Epangishmok — Black — Fall — Sage & Strawberry)

**Tool**: `west_reflection_ceremony`

**Query**: "What emotional and relational processing is needed when orchestration handoff contracts break trust?"

**Direction Response Summary**:
```
Direction: WEST (Epangishmok — Black — Fall — Sage & Strawberry)
Stage: 35-49 Years: Truth & Planning (Reflection & Transformation)

Medicines:
  Sage: Cleanses mental and emotional burdens; prepares for truth-speaking
  Strawberry: Forgiveness; release of blame; heart-shaped berry of healing
              Teaching: Brother kills brother in anger; mourns for years;
              strawberry grows on grave; eating berry brings forgiveness

Teachings:
  Truth-speaking in the talking circle
  Accountability without punishment
  Transformation through honest witnessing
```

**LLMS-txt Ontological Insight** (West):
> Orchestration Handoff Contracts belong to the West. When an agent hands off to another, it speaks truth about its current state — no omissions, no rationalizations. When contracts break (agent failure, state corruption), the strawberry teaching applies: forgiveness is the medicine, not retribution. The checkpoint is an act of West — reflection captured in writing.

